# This binding's build products. cetta.c and cetta.h are the source; the shared
# library, the four examples, the C suite, the parity driver and the benchmark
# driver are all built by the Makefile here and are one machine's binaries.
libcetta.so
examples/hello
examples/ops
examples/stream
examples/lower
tests/test_cetta
kit/driver
benchmarks/cases
